    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The usual crew heads off to summer camp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy &quot;Tent Pitching,&quot; &quot;Curry Challenge,&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Campfire Building,&quot; and more for a total of</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different activities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try gathering Collection Coins for yourself,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or challenge all activities in order to become</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a true Summer Camp Master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Tent Pitching]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the fastest to pitch the tent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Kindling Race]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up kindling and deliver it to the teachers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Nature Watching Quiz]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorize plants and animals, then take a quiz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Bug Collecting Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for bugs and catch them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Curry Challenge]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make curry and serve it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[River-Crossing Face-Off!]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross the river and don't fall in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Nighttime Treasure Hunt]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore in the dark and hunt for treasure chests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Constellation Puzzle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect the stars to form constellations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Campfire Building]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack firewood to build a sturdy fire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Folk Dance Pair]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your partner and dance!</p>",
